    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p><br/></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"61142db0-270e-4fa2-bdab-a2f7ad05aa69\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Admin ward management console allows users to create and manage IPD wards/beds. This feature is available in Bahmni EMR under &quot;<strong>Admin</strong>&quot; → &quot;<strong>Beds</strong>&quot; app. </p></div></div><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/712507393/Beds%20App%20(Admin).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790924578&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/712507393/Beds%20App%20(Admin).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790924578&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2241626147\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Beds App (Admin).png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"712507393\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"12dc396b-73bf-410e-9ab2-78ca59b985f7\" data-media-type=\"file\"></span></p><p><br/></p><h2 id=\"WardManagementAdminConsole-ManageAdmissionLocations&amp;Wards\">Manage Admission Locations &amp; Wards</h2><p>Wards are grouped under ‘Admission Locations’.</p><p>Nesting of ward hierarchy can be up to 2 levels as shown below:</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/image2018-8-31_16-39-57.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535713802427&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=435&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/712507393/image2018-8-31_16-39-57.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535713802427&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"712704018\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2018-8-31_16-39-57.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"712507393\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"fc7e155e-ec2a-4119-b0df-b0116ca16b2b\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/image2018-8-31_16-39-57.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535713802427&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=870&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/image2018-8-31_16-39-57.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535713802427&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=435&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><p>This means under Admission locations there could be a Ward with level one and under it if desired there could be other ward(s) which are room(s) under level one ward. Ward can be assigned bed layout or can have a child admission location.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Bed%20Layout%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615789818003&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=391&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/712507393/Bed%20Layout%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615789818003&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2241691670\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Bed Layout (Admin Screen).png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"712507393\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"4463058a-fd24-4c99-b973-7033995ce9bd\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Bed%20Layout%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615789818003&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=782&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Bed%20Layout%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615789818003&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=391&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><p>User can add new bed layout to admission location or child admission location by selecting ‘Set Bed Layout’.  Set the number of Rows/Columns you have in ward (like 3 Rows and 4 columns).</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0822dd20-9bb6-4093-a0f8-9d3e6f962c92\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Note</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>For an optimal bed management experience, maintain a two-level hierarchy. Do not assign bed layouts directly to wards; instead, assign them to child admission locations under the wards.</p></div></div><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Ward%20Bed%20Layout%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790498718&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=394&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/712507393/Ward%20Bed%20Layout%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790498718&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2240806932\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Ward Bed Layout (Admin Screen).png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"712507393\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"f1cbabd2-e623-4cf9-834e-a3d5469143a5\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Ward%20Bed%20Layout%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790498718&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=788&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Ward%20Bed%20Layout%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790498718&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=394&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><p>Also existing bed layout could be edited later. It could be shrunk too if beds in it are not occupied by patients. But Bed layout could always be expanded.</p><p>Bed could be added in a bed layout at a row and column with a bed type, bed number.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/image2018-8-31_16-43-2.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535713985499&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=373&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/712507393/image2018-8-31_16-43-2.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535713985499&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"712507425\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2018-8-31_16-43-2.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"712507393\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"05e36c92-f8f5-4893-b600-ba0c58c84e61\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/image2018-8-31_16-43-2.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535713985499&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=602&amp;height=403 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/image2018-8-31_16-43-2.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535713985499&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=373&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><h2 id=\"WardManagementAdminConsole-ManagingBedTypes\">Managing Bed Types</h2><p>These bed types can be added/edited by choosing the tab ‘Bed Types’ and selecting ‘Add New’/’Edit’.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Bed%20Types%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790576913&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=504&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/712507393/Bed%20Types%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790576913&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2241626136\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Bed Types (Admin Screen).png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"712507393\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"5ddd7fc1-0d99-48d9-88c7-7d33b461e4cc\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Bed%20Types%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790576913&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1008&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Bed%20Types%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790576913&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=504&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><p>While creating a Bed in Bed Layout, one can select from the list of Bed Types, to associate with the Bed.</p><p><br/></p><h2 id=\"WardManagementAdminConsole-ManagingBedTags\">Managing Bed Tags</h2><p>Bed Tags can be used to indicate special features in specific beds. For instance which beds have &quot;oxygen&quot; tanks, or have special powered beds for certain patients, etc. One can attach one/more tags to a bed to indicate optional features available in beds, so that while assigning beds to patients, one is sure an appropriate bed is assigned given the conditions/needs of the patient.</p><p>Similarly, user can create/edit bed tags by choosing the tab ‘Bed Tags’ and selecting ‘Add New’/’Edit’.</p><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Bed%20Tags%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790817151&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=406&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/712507393/Bed%20Tags%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790817151&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2241691703\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Bed Tags (Admin Screen).png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"712507393\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"32886fc3-db00-4037-968c-9e36f3b293e2\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Bed%20Tags%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790817151&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=812&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/712507393/Bed%20Tags%20(Admin%20Screen).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1615790817151&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=406&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3ecf2457-c384-4f3d-adf5-76df71218a1f\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"0d8b5b03-614e-49d7-8188-e2e1538748f7\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
